From 29899cb24929fbfaeb7685228e352260814f92c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reyyzzz24 <revayuliansatria@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:17:43 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/25] feat(ui): port shadcn/ui components manually (L2)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

button, input, label, card, form, checkbox, separator, avatar,
dropdown-menu, dialog, tooltip, tabs, scroll-area, badge, skeleton —
copied from shadcn/ui source (not via CLI, which doesn't understand this
monorepo's layout), adapted with the 'ep-' Tailwind prefix and wired to
client/lib/utils.ts's cn(). No new TS path alias added; imports are
relative per the fork's tsconfig rule.

form.tsx's error styling falls back to Tailwind's stock red-600 rather
than an Eprisi token: tokens.json has no sampled danger color (mockups
show no error state).
